Architecture note
-----------------
The runner packages revision-matched engine/embedding dex and native libraries
as toolchain artifacts. This is analogous to Flutter's prebuilt embedding and
engine AAR artifacts and Sketchware's bundled compiler libraries. The user's
Dart source is compiled to kernel, bundled, signed, and installed on Android.
The embedding template is created at runner-development time by
flutter-debug/prepare-flutter-debug.sh, not rebuilt for every user project.
